description:
AnotheReality is an interactive spatial company, that helps you maximize enterprise performances, delivering human proof immersive solutions based on Augmented (AR), Virtual (VR) and Mixed Reality (MR).

Why we are special? Through a unique combination of technological expertise, human centered design and creativity we use the potential of immersive experiences and gamification patterns to improve business results.

By leveraging our longtime experience in virtual gaming since 2014, we’ve worked across many industries with several Fortune 500 companies, on the ground of customer/employee engagement, phygital experiences, simulation and training, dematerialization of marketing and sales processes, spatial collaboration.

Our customers include: A2A, Asus, ENI, General Electric, Hitachi Engineering, Lottomatica, Merck, MSC Cargo, Nissan, Nokia, Olivetti/TIM, Prada, SkySport, Trenitalia, Widiba

Key achievements:

// Global VR/AR Association member
// Selected by YCombinator Startup School
// Recognized in 2017 as the only established XR company in Italy from dalla Global Virtual Reality Association, sponsored by Facebook
// Our board members are speakers at industry events and visiting lecturers at Politecnico di Milano, SDA Bocconi , NABA.
